The pad's menu navigation (game/pad.cpp) moves the cursor between the places a click acts on. Each focusable
widget names the centre of the rectangle its hover test uses, after its focus registration so the pad knows its focus
slot (kind 0, or 1 for a slider, which takes left and right). An open dropdown's rows, the quest list's rows and its
stage icons, which the original selects only by mouse or number keys, and the menus' clickable panels, name theirs
too (kind 2, no focus slot).
